ought (daily RSI 76, 3-day 82 & weekly 89). A momentum cross is a LAGGING confirmation: after a vertical run it only triggers once the move is mature, so the bottoming entry has already passed. This is a chase, not a fresh buy.", "next": "Don't initiate here. Wait for a pullback toward the 10-day average \u2014 or the next daily-cycle low to set up \u2014 for a lower-risk entry; hold if you're already long.", "weekly_ok": true, "regime": "bull", "regime_label": "BULLISH", "regime_why": "weekly momentum positive", "regime_score": 1.5, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BULLISH \u2014 weekly momentum positive (investor cycle week 12 \u00b7 daily cycle day 64).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a high. Bigger picture (with-trend): bullish.", "points": ["Bigger picture is bullish (with-trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average, and it's turning up"], "entry": {"tag": "DON'T CHASE", "tag_zh": "\u52ff\u8ffd\u9ad8", "urgency": "caution", "text": "You missed the bottoming entry \u2014 the low already formed and price is now extended (overbought (daily RSI 76, 3-day 82 & weekly 89)). Don't chase; wait for a pullback to the 10-day average or the next cycle low. Hold if already long.", "text_zh": "\u5df2\u9519\u8fc7\u7b51\u5e95\u5165\u573a\u2014\u2014\u4f4e\u70b9\u5df2\u7ecf\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u76ee\u524d\u4ef7\u683c\u5df2\u62c9\u4f38\uff08\u5df2\u8d85\u4e70\uff08\u65e5\u7ebf RSI 76\u30013 \u65e5 82 \u4e0e\u5468\u7ebf 89\uff09\uff09\u3002\u4e0d\u8981\u8ffd\u9ad8\uff1b\u7b49\u5f85\u56de\u8c03\u81f3 10 \u65e5\u5747\u7ebf\u6216\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u3002\u82e5\u5df2\u6301\u6709\u5219\u7ee7\u7eed\u6301\u6709\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 64 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "overdue \u2014 past the typical window, so a low could form any day", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u54